<title>USA: Tasty Fries holders approve reverse split.</title>
<headline>Tasty Fries holders approve reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pennsylvania 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasty Fries Inc on Friday said a majority of its shareholders had approved a one-for-20 reverse split.</p>
